{"id": 1013523, "slug": "releaseburg", "name": "Releaseburg", "name_original": "Releaseburg", "description": "Welcome to the relentless world of Blood Purge: Releaseburg, an immersive <strong>rogue-like</strong> experience set in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by hordes of gruesome <strong>zombies</strong>. With our exceptional <strong>release-based shooting</strong> mechanic, every encounter becomes a thrilling test of precision and strategy.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Arm yourself with a diverse array of weapons, from <strong>pistols </strong>for quick, calculated shots to <strong>rifles </strong>for strategic precision and <strong>burst-fire </strong>for close-quarters mayhem. Adapt your play style to navigate the blood-soaked streets and face various challenging enemies, each demanding a unique approach to survival.<br/><br/><br/><br/>The game's dynamic, random-generated levels ensure that no two playthroughs are ever the same, providing endless challenges and opportunities for exploration. Brace yourself for intense, visceral encounters as you wade through the <strong>blood and gore</strong>, carving your path through the unforgiving urban landscape. Blood Purge: Releaseburg promises a gripping, ever-evolving adventure where your every decision and shot can mean the difference between survival and becoming just another victim in this brutal, post-apocalyptic world.<br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-10-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-11-03T11:04:24", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/421/421e51599e6ff1ab5e1afd2599c4212d.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/2d3/2d3cff5f8d654e2368d3f71ddf396401.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit